{"id":"ambiente","lemma":"ambiente","pos":"noun","rank":1755,"glosses":["atmosphere","environment (used with medio when talking about nature)","room"],"ipa":"/amˈbjente/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ambientes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ambiente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Necesito un cambio de ambiente.","en":"I need a change of scenery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/510067","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"change, shift"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Esto es malo para el medio ambiente.","en":"This is bad for the environment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684466","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"bad"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"half"},null]},{"text":"Nuestro ambiente de trabajo era bueno.","en":"Our working environment was good.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741271","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"work, job"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"good"}]},{"text":"Debemos intentar proteger el medio ambiente.","en":"We must try to protect the environment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611102","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to try, to attempt"},{"g":"to protect, to defend"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"half"},null]},{"text":"Nuestras vidas están determinadas por nuestro medio ambiente.","en":"Our lives are determined by our environment.","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"life","l":"vida"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"determinate","l":"determinado"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"our, ours, to us"},{"g":"half"},null]}]}